  "body": "Discover the pinnacle of coastal living at Lot 12 Okura Bay Views, Long Bay. This meticulously designed 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home with a study and pool offers 263 sqm of luxury living space on a 493 sqm lot, showcasing breathtaking ocean and rural views.\r\n\r\nBuilt by David Reid Homes, this property is crafted with the highest standards, ensuring peace of mind with a long-standing reputation for quality. Enjoy seamless indoor-outdoor living, expansive vistas, and the tranquility of a prime location that offers both urban convenience and natural beauty.\r\n\r\nYou will have peace of mind knowing your home has been designed and built by David Reid Homes who have a long-standing reputation for designing and building high quality homes. \r\n\r\nWalking distance to: \r\n\r\nLong Bay Regional Park & Beach \r\n\r\nLong Bay College \r\n\r\nLong Bay Surf Club \r\n\r\nLong Bay Village and New World  \r\n\r\n \r\nA comprehensive structural and workmanship guarantee of up to 10 years is included.? \r\n\r\nCall Dean or Jamie now to find out more.",
